00:43:29.000 --> 00:43:31.000
It's unconstitutionally vague.

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:38.000
And it got even broader and vaguer in my case when Judge Leanny Brinkama of the Eastern District of Virginia

00:43:38.000 --> 00:43:46.000
