00:51:23.760 --> 00:51:25.480
venue clause just means for people to don't know,

00:51:25.480 --> 00:51:27.720
it's just that all federal criminal trials

00:51:27.720 --> 00:51:29.400
have to be in the state and the district

00:51:29.400 --> 00:51:30.760
where the crime occurred.

00:51:30.760 --> 00:51:32.960
And the point of that was to try to avoid

00:51:32.960 --> 00:51:37.120
that kind of social club dynamic

00:51:37.120 --> 00:51:38.740
that's already just gonna condemn you

00:51:38.740 --> 00:51:41.760
before you're even there, because the revolutionaries,

00:51:41.760 --> 00:51:42.960
you get arrested in Philadelphia,

00:51:42.960 --> 00:51:44.400
but you do a jury trial in London,

00:51:44.400 --> 00:51:46.720
it's a very, very different thing.

00:51:46.720 --> 00:51:50.000
And down in EDVA, I don't even,

00:51:50.000 --> 00:51:51.680
like it's not even an independent judiciary

00:51:51.680 --> 00:51:53.400
when it comes to that kind of stuff.

00:51:53.400 --> 00:51:55.480
No way, I'll tell you something funny too.

00:51:57.200 --> 00:51:58.640
At the time of my,

00:52:00.560 --> 00:52:03.960
what was going to be my trial,

00:52:03.960 --> 00:52:08.960
my best friend's wife's uncle was introduced to me.

00:52:09.520 --> 00:52:12.000
He was O.J. Simpson's jury consultant.

00:52:12.000 --> 00:52:12.840
Oh wow.

00:52:12.840 --> 00:52:15.200
And besides O.J. Simpson, he did George Simmerman,

00:52:15.200 --> 00:52:18.400
he did William Kennedy Smith,

00:52:18.400 --> 00:52:22.640
all these major headline grabbing cases,

00:52:22.640 --> 00:52:24.840
and he had never lost a case.

00:52:24.840 --> 00:52:27.160
So he was very, very expensive,

00:52:27.160 --> 00:52:29.920
but because this was my best friend's wife,

00:52:30.920 --> 00:52:33.920
he agreed to help me for free.

00:52:33.920 --> 00:52:34.760
Wow.

00:52:34.760 --> 00:52:35.600
Wow, that's a score.

00:52:35.600 --> 00:52:36.720
It was a score.

00:52:36.720 --> 00:52:39.240
We got him a security clearance, which was tough.

00:52:40.880 --> 00:52:42.920
It was another thing that we had to fight over.

