Next day he's got a security clearance.

00:53:04.760 --> 00:53:09.400
So he came up, went through all the documents,

00:53:09.400 --> 00:53:14.000
and I still remember sitting around the enormous table

00:53:14.040 --> 00:53:16.360
in the law firm's conference room,

00:53:16.360 --> 00:53:21.360
and he said, if we were in any other district in America,

