But the Eastern District of Virginia,

00:53:28.800 --> 00:53:31.720
he said your jury is gonna be made up of people

00:53:31.720 --> 00:53:34.840
who work for the Pentagon and the CIA

00:53:34.840 --> 00:53:38.680
and defense contractors or their relatives.

00:53:38.680 --> 00:53:42.000
He said, you can't possibly get a fair trial

00:53:42.040 --> 00:53:44.760
in the Eastern District of Virginia.

00:53:44.760 --> 00:53:47.440
He said, I can't believe I'm gonna say it,

00:53:47.440 --> 00:53:49.200
