00:53:49.200 --> 00:53:52.520
Yeah, and that's one of the best jury consultants

00:53:52.520 --> 00:53:53.360
in the country.

00:53:53.360 --> 00:53:54.200
Yeah, he was the best.

00:53:54.200 --> 00:53:55.040
Yeah, he was the best.

