And that's true, and that's why Assange is not

00:53:58.640 --> 00:53:59.640
going to get a fair trial.

00:53:59.640 --> 00:54:00.640
He doesn't stand a chance.

00:54:00.640 --> 00:54:02.120
Doesn't stand a chance, yeah.

00:54:02.120 --> 00:54:03.960
No, that's not gonna be good.

00:54:03.960 --> 00:54:05.160
And they're gonna throw him in the shoe.

00:54:05.160 --> 00:54:06.000
Sure they will.

00:54:06.000 --> 00:54:06.840
Yeah, yeah.

