00:54:19.240 --> 00:54:21.080
I said, first of all, I explained

00:54:21.080 --> 00:54:24.040
that the Bureau of Prisons answers to nobody.

00:54:24.040 --> 00:54:26.200
They don't care what the judge says.

00:54:26.200 --> 00:54:27.560
They don't care what the prosecutors say.

00:54:27.560 --> 00:54:30.120
They're gonna put him wherever they decide to put him.

00:54:30.120 --> 00:54:34.160
So the prosecutors can promise every judge in the UK

00:54:34.160 --> 00:54:36.360
that they're not gonna put him in the CMU.

00:54:36.360 --> 00:54:38.640
That's not their promise to make.

00:54:38.640 --> 00:54:41.480
But even if they don't put him in the CMU,

00:54:41.480 --> 00:54:44.480
all they need to put him in the shoe,

00:54:44.480 --> 00:54:45.920
for years, right?

00:54:45.920 --> 00:54:48.000
We've had people in solitary confinement

00:54:48.000 --> 00:54:52.280
for 44 years in this country, as long as 44 years.

00:54:52.280 --> 00:54:55.560
All they have to do is say, well, you know what?

