00:55:02.080 --> 00:55:05.640
So quote unquote for his own safety,

00:55:05.640 --> 00:55:06.880
they're gonna put him in solitary

00:55:06.920 --> 00:55:08.840
and he's gonna spend the rest of his life in there.

00:55:08.840 --> 00:55:10.480
And for people who don't know this,

00:55:10.480 --> 00:55:13.320
the United Nations considers solitary confinement

00:55:13.320 --> 00:55:14.600
a form of torture.

00:55:14.600 --> 00:55:17.960
Anything more than 14 days is a form of torture.

00:55:17.960 --> 00:55:19.720
And if you think it's not,

00:55:19.720 --> 00:55:22.040
try locking yourself in a closet just for 24 hours.

00:55:22.040 --> 00:55:26.080
And it's totally inhumane.

00:55:26.080 --> 00:55:28.000
And they do it to a lot of our hacker clients

00:55:28.000 --> 00:55:30.320
who haven't done really anything.

