01:01:56.900 --> 01:02:01.140
And so everybody runs to the side of the boat and they're taking pictures.

01:02:01.140 --> 01:02:09.220
Somebody whistles, right, just in a silly attempt to keep the whale up near the surface

01:02:09.220 --> 01:02:10.900
so they could take better pictures.

